name: "ast_loader"
type: "module"
about: "
Loads AiR source files from disk and parses them into an AST.

Pipeline: file path → read source → tokenize → parse_program → TableNode AST

Entry point: load_file(file_path) → TableNode

Errors:
  FileNotFoundError  — file could not be read
  ValueError         — tokenizer or parser rejected the source
"
